      </article>

      <article>
        <h2>18. Notices and contact</h2>
        <p>
          Legal and contractual notices must be sent to:
        </p>
        <div class="contact-block">
          <p><strong>[YOUR LEGAL ENTITY NAME]</strong></p>
          <p>[REGISTERED BUSINESS ADDRESS, CITY, STATE, PIN]</p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@meshwg.com">hello@meshwg.com</a></p>
          <p>Phone: [+91-XXXXX-XXXXX]</p>
